</surname><given-names>AV</given-names></name><name><surname>Wilson</surname><given-names>WR</given-names></name><name><surname>Denny</surname><given-names>WA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Synthesis and structure-activity relationships for 2,4-Dinitrobenzamide-5-mustards as prodrugs for the Escherichia coli nfsB nitroreductase in gene therapy</article-title><source>J Med Chem</source><year>2007</year><volume>50</volume><supplement>6</supplement><fpage>1197</fpage><lpage>212</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Med Chem||50|1197||bib4|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17326614</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib5"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bailey</surname><given-names>SM</given-names></name><name><surname>Knox</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Hobbs</surname><given-names>SM</given-names></name><name><surname>Jenkins</surname><given-names>TC</given-names></name><name><surname>Mauger</surname><given-names>AB</given-names></name><name><surname>Melton</surname><given-names>RG</given-names></name><name><surname>Burke</surname><given-names>PJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Connors</surname><given-names>TA</given-names></name><name><surname>Hart</surname><given-names>IR</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Investigation of alternative prodrugs for use with E coli nitroreductase in &#x02018;suicide gene' approaches to cancer therapy</article-title><source>Gene Ther</source><year>1996</year><volume>3</volume><fpage>1143</fpage><lpage>1150</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Gene Ther||3|1143||bib5|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8986441</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib6"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Barak</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Thorne</surname><given-names>SH</given-names></name><name><surname>Ackerley</surname><given-names>DF</given-names></name><name><